$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Air";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Deus" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> MidNight" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other at close range with their massive flying bases.  The Center Base could prove to be most helpful to the Tribe that holds it. Each Tribe must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touch it to their own flag to capture it.  The first Tribe with 6 captures shall be the victor!" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Map By:<f4> Lisa W. (LadyShar).... Find all my maps at http://welcome.to/LadyShars";
